            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "We summarize the development of the new Graphical User Interfaces (GUIs) for Poly3D and Dynel numerical codes, running under Windows operating system and using OpenGL and OpenInventor technologies. The core libraries are presented (P3Dtools kernel), as well as the two applications using these libraries: Poly3DGUI and DynelGUI.",
